    {'padas': ['imaṃ taṃ paśya vṛṣabhasya yuñjaṃ kāṣṭhāyā madhye drughaṇaṃ śayānam |', 'yena jigāya śatavatsahasraṃ gavāṃ mudgalaḥ pṛtanājyeṣu ||', "imaṃ taṃ paśya vṛṣabhasya sahayujaṃ kāṣṭhāyā madhye drughaṇaṃ śayānam | yena jigāya śatavatsahasraṃ gavāṃ mudgalaḥ pṛtanājyeṣu | pṛtanājyamiti saṅgrāmanāma | pṛtanānāmajanādvā | jayanādvā | mudgalo mudgavān | mudgagilo [ vā ] | madanaṃ gilatīti vā | madaṃgilo vā | mudaṃgilo vā | bhārmyaśvo bhṛmyaśvasya putraḥ | bhṛmyaśvo bhṛmayo'syāśvāḥ | aśvabharaṇādvā |", 'piturityannanāma | pātervā | pibatervā | pyāyatervā | tasyaiṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 24 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 10.102.9: see the club lying by the bull, with which Mudgala won the cows in battle. Pṛtanājya; Mudgala, Bhārmyaśva. Pitu, food.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.25 · Pitu'},
    {'padas': ['pituṃ nu stoṣaṃ maho dharmāṇaṃ taviṣīm |', 'yasya trito vyojasā vṛtraṃ viparvamardayat ||', 'taṃ pituṃ staumi mahato dhārayitāraṃ balasya | taviṣīti balanāma | tavateḥ [ vā ] vṛddhikarmaṇaḥ | yasya trita ojasā balena | tritastristhāna indro vṛtraṃ viparvāṇaṃ vyardayati |', 'nadyo vyākhyātāḥ | tāsāmeṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 25 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 1.187.1: now I will praise food, the great upholder of strength, by whose might Trita tore Vṛtra apart. Taviṣī. The rivers.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.26 · The rivers of the Punjab'},
    {'padas': ['imaṃ me gaṅge yamune sarasvati śutudri stomaṃ sacatā paruṣṇyā |', 'asiknyā marudvṛdhe vitastayārjīkīye śṛṇuhyā suṣomayā ||', "imaṃ me gaṅge yamune sarasvati śutudri paruṣṇi stomamāsevadhvam | asiknyā ca saha marudvṛdhe vitastayā cārjīkīya āśṛṇuhi suṣomayā ceti samastārthaḥ | athaikapadaniruktam | gaṅgā gamanāt | yamunā prayuvatī gacchatīti vā | praviyutaṃ gacchatīti vā | sarasvatī | sara ityudakanāma | sarteḥ | tadvatī | śutudrī śudrāviṇī | kṣipradrāviṇī | āśu tunneva dravatīti vā | irāvatīṃ paruṣṇītyāhuḥ | parvavatī [ bhāsvatī ] kuṭilagāminī | asiknyaśuklāsitā | sitamiti varṇanāma | tatpratiṣedho'sitam | marudvṛdhāḥ sarvā nadyo maruta enā vardhayanti | vitastāvidagdhā vivṛddhā mahākūlā | ārjīkīyāṃ vipāḍityāhuḥ | ṛjīkaprabhavā vā | ṛjugāminī vā | vipāḍ vipāṭanādvā | vipāśanādvā | viprāpaṇādvā | pāśā asyāṃ vyapāśyanta vasiṣṭhasya mumūrṣataḥ | tasmādvipāḍucyate | pūrvamāsīduruñjirā | suṣomā sindhuḥ | yadenāmabhiprasuvanti nadyaḥ | sindhuḥ syandanāt |", 'āpa āpnoteḥ | tāsāmeṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 26 ||', 'gloss': "Ṛgveda 10.75.5: Gaṅgā, Yamunā, Sarasvatī, Śutudrī, hear my praise with Paruṣṇī; Asiknī, Marudvṛdhā, Vitastā, Ārjīkīyā with Suṣomā. Each name derived: Paruṣṇī is the Irāvatī, Ārjīkīyā the Vipāś, freed of Vasiṣṭha's fetters.", 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.27 · The waters; the plants'},
    {'padas': ['āpo hi ṣṭhā mayobhuvastā na ūrje dadhātana |', 'mahe raṇāya cakṣase ||', "āpo hi stha sukhabhuvastā no'nnāya dhatta | mahate ca no raṇāya ramaṇīyāya [ ca ] darśanāya |", 'oṣadhaya oṣaddhayantīti vā | oṣatyenā dhayantīti vā | doṣaṃ dhayantīti vā |', 'tāsāmeṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 27 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 10.9.1: you waters are refreshing; give us strength for great joy and sight. The plants, oṣadhi.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.28 · The plants'},
    {'padas': ['yā oṣadhīḥ pūrvā jātā devebhyastriyugaṃ purā |', 'manai nu babhrūṇāmahaṃ śataṃ dhāmāni sapta ca ||', 'yā oṣadhayaḥ pūrvā jātā devebhyastrīṇi yugāni purā manye nu tadbabhrūṇāmahaṃ babhruvarṇānāṃ haraṇānāṃ bharaṇānāmiti vā | śataṃ dhāmāni sapta ca [ iti ] | dhāmāni trayāṇi bhavanti | sthānāni | nāmāni | janmānīti | janmānyatrābhipretāni | saptaśataṃ puruṣasya marmaṇāṃ teṣvenā dadhatīti vā |', 'rātrirvyākhyātā | tasyā eṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 28 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 10.97.1: of the plants born three ages before the gods, I think of the hundred and seven forms of the brown ones. Dhāman: abodes, names, births. Night.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.29 · Night'},
    {'padas': ['ā rātri pārthivaṃ rajaḥ pituraprāyi dhāmabhiḥ |', 'divaḥ sadāṃsi bṛhatī vi tiṣṭhasa ā tveṣaṃ vartate tamaḥ ||', 'āpūpurastvaṃ rātri pārthivaṃ rajaḥ | sthānairmadhyamasya | divaḥ sadāṃsi | bṛhatī mahatī vitiṣṭhasa āvartate tveṣaṃ tamo rajaḥ |', 'araṇyānyaraṇyasya patnī | araṇyamapārṇam | grāmādaramaṇaṃ bhavatīti vā | tasyā eṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 29 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 10.127.2: you have filled the earthly region, night, and the seats of the sky. The forest spirit, Araṇyānī.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.30 · Araṇyānī'},
    {'padas': ['araṇyānyaraṇyānyasau yā preva naśyasi |', 'kathā grāmaṃ na pṛcchasi na tvā bhīriva vindatī3ṁ ||', 'araṇyānītyenāmāmantrayate | yāsāvaraṇyāni vanāni parācīva naśyasi kathaṃ grāmaṃ na pṛcchasi | na tvā bhīrvindatīveti | ivaḥ paribhayārthe vā |', 'śraddhā śraddhānāt | tasyā eṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 30 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 10.146.1: Araṇyānī, you who seem to vanish, why do you not ask the way to the village? Does fear not find you? Faith, śraddhā.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.31 · Faith'},
    {'padas': ['śraddhayāgniḥ samidhyate śraddhayā hūyate haviḥ |', 'śraddhāṃ bhagasya mūrdhani vacasā vedayāmasi ||', 'śraddhayāgniḥ sādhu samidhyate | śraddhayā haviḥ sādhu hūyate | śraddhāṃ bhagasya bhāgadheyasya mūrdhani pradhānāṅge vacanenāvedayāmaḥ |', 'pṛthivī vyākhyātā | tasyā eṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 31 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 10.151.1: by faith the fire is kindled, by faith the oblation offered. The earth.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.32 · The earth'},
    {'padas': ['syonā pṛthivi bhavānṛkṣarā niveśanī |', 'yacchā naḥ śarma saprathaḥ ||', 'sukhā naḥ pṛthivi bhava | anṛkṣarā niveśanī | ṛkṣaraḥ kaṇṭaka ṛcchateḥ | kaṇṭakaḥ kantapo vā | kṛntatervā | kaṇṭatervā syādgatikarmaṇaḥ | udgatatamo bhavati | yaccha naḥ śarma | [ yacchantu ] śaraṇaṃ sarvataḥ pṛthu |', 'apvā vyākhyātā | tasyā eṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 32 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 1.22.15: be pleasant, earth, thornless, a resting place; give us wide shelter. Ṛkṣara, kaṇṭaka. Apvā.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.33 · Apvā'},
    {'padas': ['amīṣāṃ cittaṃ pratilobhayantī gṛhāṇāṅgānyapve parehi |', 'abhi prehi nirdaha hṛtsu śokairandhenāmitrāstamasā sacantām ||', 'amīṣāṃ cittāni [ prajñānāni ] pratilobhayamānā gṛhāṇāṅgānyapve parehi | abhiprehi | nirdahaiṣāṃ hṛdayāni śokaiḥ | andhenāmitrāstamasā saṃsevyantām |', 'agnāyyagneḥ patnī | tasyā eṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 33 ||', 'gloss': "Ṛgveda 10.103.12: bewilder their minds, Apvā, seize their limbs, burn their hearts with grief. Agnāyī, Agni's wife.", 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.34 · Agnāyī'},
    {'padas': ['ihendrāṇīmupa hvaye varuṇānīṃ svastaye |', 'agnāyīṃ somapītaye ||', 'iti sā nigadavyākhyātā'], 'num': '|| 34 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 1.22.12: I call here Indrāṇī, Varuṇānī and Agnāyī to drink the soma.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.35 · The eight pairs; mortar and pestle'},
    {'padas': ["athāto'ṣṭau dvandvāni | [ ulūkhalamusale | ] ulūkhalaṃ vyākhyātam | musalaṃ muhuḥ saram | tayoreṣā bhavati"], 'num': '|| 35 ||', 'gloss': 'Now the eight pairs, first the mortar and pestle; musala, the pestle.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.36 · Mortar and pestle; the two havirdhāna carts'},
    {'padas': ['āyajī vājasātamā tā hyuccā vijarbhṛtaḥ |', 'harī ivāndhāṃsi bapsatā ||', 'āyaṣṭavye annānāṃ saṃbhaktatame te hyuccairvihriyete harī ivānnāni bhuñjāne |', 'havirdhāne haviṣāṃ nidhāne | tayoreṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 36 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 1.28.7: the two worshipful ones, best winners of food, are raised high like two bays eating their fodder. The havirdhāna carts.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.37 · The carts; heaven and earth'},
    {'padas': ['ā vāmupasthamadruhā devāḥ sīdantu yajñiyāḥ |', 'ihādya somapītaye ||', 'āsīdantu vāmupasthamupasthānam [ adrogdhavye iti vā ] yajñiyā devā yajñasaṃpādina ihādya somapānāya |', 'dyāvāpṛthivyau vyākhyāte | tayoreṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 37 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 2.41.21: let the worshipful gods sit in your lap to drink soma. Heaven and earth.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.38 · Heaven and earth; Vipāś and Śutudrī'},
    {'padas': ['dyāvā naḥ pṛthivī imaṃ sidhramadya divispṛśam |', 'yajñaṃ deveṣu yacchatām ||', 'dyāvāpṛthivyau na imaṃ sādhanamadya divispṛśaṃ yajñaṃ deveṣu niyacchatām |', 'vipāṭchutudryau vyākhyāte | tayoreṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 38 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 2.41.20: may heaven and earth carry this sacrifice to the gods. The two rivers.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.39 · Vipāś and Śutudrī; the bow-tips'},
    {'padas': ['pra parvatānāmuśatī upasthādaśve iva viṣite hāsamāne |', 'gāveva śubhre mātarā rihāṇe vipāṭchutudrī payasā javete ||', 'parvatānāmupasthādupasthānāt | uśatyau kāmayamāne | aśve iva vimukte iti vā | viṣaṇṇe iti vā | hāsamāne | hāsati spardhāyām | harṣamāṇe vā | gāvāviva [ śubhre ] śobhane mātarau saṃrihāṇe | vipāṭchutudrī payasā prajavete |', 'ārtnī artanyau vā | araṇyau vā | ariṣaṇyau vā |', 'tayoreṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 39 ||', 'gloss': "Ṛgveda 3.33.1: eager, from the mountains' lap, like two mares let loose, like two bright mother cows, Vipāś and Śutudrī rush with their waters. Ārtnī, the bow-tips.", 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.40 · The bow-tips; Śunāsīra'},
    {'padas': ['te ācarantī samaneva yoṣā māteva putraṃ bibhṛtāmupasthe |', 'apa śatrūnvidhyatāṃ saṃvidāne ārtnī ime viṣphurantī amitrān ||', 'te ācarantyau samanasāviva yoṣe māteva putraṃ bibhṛtāmupastha upasthāne | apavidhyatāṃ śatrūntsaṃvidāne ārtnyāvime vighnatyāvamitrān |', 'śunāsīrau | śuno vāyuḥ | śu etyantarikṣe | sīra ādityaḥ saraṇāt | tayoreṣā bhavati'], 'num': '|| 40 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 6.75.4: moving like two women of one mind, holding the arrow as a mother her child, may the bow-tips pierce the enemy. Śuna (Vāyu) and Sīra (the sun).', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.41 · Śunāsīra; the two goddesses Joṣṭrī'},
    {'padas': ['śunāsīrāvimāṃ vācaṃ juṣethāṃ yaddivi cakrathuḥ payaḥ |', 'tenemāmupa siñcatam ||', 'iti sā nigadavyākhyātā |', 'devī joṣṭrī devyau joṣayitryau | dyāvāpṛthivyāviti vā | ahorātre iti vā | sasyaṃ ca samā ceti kātthakyaḥ | tayoreṣa saṃpraiṣo bhavati'], 'num': '|| 41 ||', 'gloss': 'Ṛgveda 4.57.5: Śunāsīra, enjoy this praise; sprinkle this earth with the milk you made in heaven. The goddesses Joṣṭrī: heaven and earth, day and night, or crop and year.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.42 · Joṣṭrī; Ūrjāhutī'},
    {'padas': ['devī joṣṭrī vasudhitī yayoranyāghā dveṣāṃsi yūyavadānyā vakṣadvasu vāryāṇi yajamānāya vasuvane vasudheyasya vītāṃ yaja ||', 'devī joṣṭrī | devyau joṣayitryau | [ vasudhitī ] vasudhānyau | yayoranyāghāni dveṣāṃsyavayāvayatyāvahatyanyā vasūni vananīyāni yajamānāya | vasuvananāya ca | vasudhānāya ca | vītāṃ pibetāṃ kāmayetāṃ vā | yajeti saṃpraiṣaḥ |', 'devī ūrjāhutī | devyā ūrjāhvānyau | dyāvāpṛthivyāviti vā | ahorātra iti vā | sasyaṃ ca samā ceti kātthakyaḥ | tayoreṣa saṃpraiṣo bhavati'], 'num': '|| 42 ||', 'gloss': 'The praiṣa for the two Joṣṭrīs, one driving away evils, the other bringing wealth. The goddesses Ūrjāhutī.', 'prose': True},
    {'heading': '9.43 · Ūrjāhutī'},
    {'padas': ['devī ūrjāhutī iṣamūrjamanyā vakṣatsagdhiṃ sapītimanyā navena pūrvaṃ dayamānāḥ syāma purāṇena navaṃ tāmūrjamūrjāhutī ūrjayamāne adhātāṃ vasuvane vasudheyasya vītāṃ yaja ||', 'devī ūrjāhutī | devyā ūrjāhvānyau | annaṃ ca rasaṃ cāvahati [ āvahati ] anyā | sahajagdhiṃ ca sahapītiṃ cānyā | navena pūrvaṃ dayamānāḥ syāma | purāṇena navam | tāmūrjamūrjāhutī ūrjayamāne adhātām | vasuvananāya ca | vasudhānāya ca | vītāṃ pibetāṃ kāmayetāṃ vā | yajeti saṃpraiṣo yajeti saṃpraiṣaḥ'], 'num': '|| 43 ||', 'gloss': 'The praiṣa for the two Ūrjāhutīs, one bringing food and drink, the other shared eating and drinking.', 'prose': True},
    {'colophon': "|| iti navamo'dhyāyaḥ ||", 'gloss': 'Thus the ninth adhyāya.'},
    {'rubric': 'The khaṇḍānukramaṇī, the opening words of the forty-three khaṇḍas, which Sarup prints in brackets after the adhyāya.'},
    {'padas': ["[ atha yānyaśvo voḷhā mā no mitraḥ kanikradad bhadraṃ vada saṃvatsaramupa pra vada prāvepā mā praite vadantvamandānyajñasaṃyogādvanaspata upa śvāsaya bahvīnāmahiriva bhogai rathe tiṣṭhandhanvanā gā vakṣyantīvedā suparṇaṃ vasta ā jaṅghanti yacciddhi tvaṃ vṛṣabho nyakrandayannimaṃ taṃ pituṃ nvimaṃ ma āpo hi ṣṭhā yā oṣadhīrā rātryaraṇyāni śraddhayāgniḥ syonāmīṣāṃ cittamihendrāṇyathāto'ṣṭāvāyajī vāṃ dyāvā naḥ pra parvatānāṃ te ācarantī śunāsīrau devī joṣṭrī devī ūrjāhutī tricatvāriṃśat || ]"], 'num': '', 'gloss': '', 'prose': True},
    {'colophon': "|| ityuttaraṣaṭke tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ ||", 'gloss': 'Thus the third adhyāya of the second six.'},
    {'colophon': "|| iti nirukte navamo'dhyāyaḥ ||", 'gloss': 'Here ends the ninth adhyāya of the Nirukta.'},
